                                                "sense_id": "075776ca-7f27-37d0-bd0b-ba013d52d020",
                                                "text": "“Ensign, the bridge is yours. Be gentle but attentive. Get her where she needs to be. Guide her home.” “Okeydokey. (chuckles) Uh, maintain course.” (all screaming) (alarm blaring)"
                                            },
